# CloudFormation Extension Templates
# Placeholder for rare use cases not covered by Terraform AWS provider.
# Primary IaC approach is Terraform (see tasks.md). CFN extensions are used only when:
# - AWS Terraform provider lacks support for a specific resource
# - Custom logic requires CloudFormation-only features
#
# Example use cases:
# - Custom CloudFormation resources via Lambda-backed handlers
# - AWS service integrations not yet available in Terraform provider
#
# Note: Most infrastructure is managed via Terraform modules in platform/
